The first module proves a same-frame two-sided absolute displacement bound, including zero evaluations. The paper derives signed constants from the intermediate diagonal inequalities in the upstream proof. The second module proves the direct recorded-to-Bergman component volume inequality at the original degree, with the original multiplier as a hypothesis. The paper's small-section existence and the recorded mean bound are separate arithmetic-geometric inputs.
